// Repro (2026-11-19): a two-note tremolo with its beams joined to both stems, as old prints engrave it (Kuecken Op.47-3,
// Fr. Kistner 1711, bars 60-72: page 6 bar 66's left hand, <fis b> and dis' a dotted quarter's worth). lysc and LilyPond's
// default keep the beams off the stems; LilyPond's \override Beam.gap = #0 joins them.
octave absolute
time 6/8
key b major
part lh { clef bass }

section A {
  lh {
    repeat tremolo 12 { <fis b>64 dis'64 } repeat tremolo 12 { <fis b>64 dis'64 } |
  }
}

score { staff lh }